      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": null,
      "text": "Main model = SignCLIP (sign-language model, 7/7 on your hellos).  Backup = SL-GCN.  Jev = optional cloud 2nd opinion.  Gemma = not for signs (no motion, no ISL training).",
      "originalText": "Main model = SignCLIP (sign-language model, 7/7 on your hellos).  Backup = SL-GCN.  Jev = optional cloud 2nd opinion.  Gemma = not for signs (no motion, no ISL training).",
