      "text": "Camera pill colours\n\n● green  = watching, hands at rest\n● yellow = sign in progress\n● red    = can't see you\n            (move back / hands\n             not visible)\n\nChip colours\n\ngreen [word ✕] = recognised,\n   tap ✕ to remove\nred   [ ? ]    = unsure,\n   nothing will be spoken",
